  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 671186830}
  teacherName: Gonzales
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 1682159503}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1703683720}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  initalLines:
  - Hey there!
  - Learning more about life magic are we?
  - "Everyone calls it plant magic, but it\u2019s so much more than that; precision
    is important."
  - To fully harness the power of this magic, you have to understand the fundamental
    makeup of various plants.
  - Learn more about the plants around the room.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - You did it.
  - See, what you did was sensing the energy signature in each plant.
  - Now get a taste of this energy, observe and learn.
  afterBattleLines:
  - Not bad.
  - Take this spell.
  afterSpellLines:
  - A word of advice, some elements are more difficult to master than others.
  - "Don\u2019t waste your energy trying to master them all."
  - Stay safe. Get on your way.
